# Cunning Maneuver: "Target creature gets +3/+1 until end of turn. Create a Clue token." {1}{R} is paid exactly (Mox Ruby and Mox
# Jet, the pool left empty). A Mox is an artifact but no creature, so it is refused as the target while the Ornithopter is legal.
# Bot1's own 0/2 Ornithopter becomes 3/3 and a Clue token enters; in turn 3 the Ornithopter is 0/2 again (CR 514.2).

